Description: Local-first AI development environment
 RuntimeForce IDE is a local-first AI development environment with local
 workspaces, SSH, Git, AI model integrations, and project memory.
 The application runs as the logged-in desktop user. Each Linux account
 has its own configuration, encryption key, database, cache, and service.
